      "date": "2026-11-10 11:48:34.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 2:\n\n(1 comment)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nLooks good; one optional style nit inline for whenever the patch is next refreshed, no need to re-spin for it.\n\nSeparately, as a suggestion for a follow-up patch rather than this one: the gnilnd LND has the same pre-existing pattern of on-stack timers set up with timer_setup(): `struct kgnilnd_dgram_timer timer` in kgnilnd_dgram_mover() (lnet/klnds/gnilnd/gnilnd_conn.c) and `struct timer_list timer` in kgnilnd_reaper() (lnet/klnds/gnilnd/gnilnd_cb.c). With CONFIG_DEBUG_OBJECTS_TIMERS these would hit the same ODEBUG warning, and they could use the new timer_destroy_on_stack() mapping as well.",
