          "tz": -480
        },
        "subject": "LU-21172 lod: annotate on-stack timer in lod_ost_alloc_qos",
        "message": "LU-21172 lod: annotate on-stack timer in lod_ost_alloc_qos\n\nlod_ost_alloc_qos() keeps its semaphore timer on the stack but\nsets it up with timer_setup(). With CONFIG_DEBUG_OBJECTS_TIMERS\nthis prints \"ODEBUG: object ... is on stack ..., but NOT\nannotated\", e.g. in recovery-small test_152.\n\nUse timer_setup_on_stack() and timer_destroy_on_stack(). Linux 6.16\nrenamed destroy_timer_on_stack() to timer_destroy_on_stack(), and\nel10.2 has the new name, so add a configure check that maps the new\nname to the old one on older kernels.\n\nFixes: f46782b4c7dc (\"LU-15393 lod: use killable semaphore for creation path\")\nSigned-off-by: Hiroshi Nishida <hnishida@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: I0bfd6e3e894930567103c553b8de1cc6f2bec341\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
